Z||000000||Gold-86SE||05-08-2000||10:51 AM||||What movies do you guys plan on seeing this summer?<P>Me:<BR>U571 - seen, good btw<BR>Battlefield Earth - travolta flick<BR>MI-2 - speaks for itself, much antcipated<BR>Titan AE - animated sci-fi<BR>Gladiator - Roman Empire, most anything set in Empiral Rome is good<BR>The Patriot - Mel Gibson movie<BR>Shanghai Noon - Jackie Chan kungfu/slapstick schtick||||reg||6
